{"availability":"available","full":"MDRYLA/q2-second-brain-demo","name":"q2-second-brain-demo","description":"Public portfolio version of Q2 — personal Second Brain + Coach app (Next.js 16 + Supabase + E2E AES-GCM client-side encryption). Submitted to Bison Fellowship 2026.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-09T23:23:15Z","updated":"2026-08-03T04:18:04Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://q2-second-brain-demo.vercel.app","topics":["bison-fellowship","e2e-encryption","nextjs","portfolio","react","supabase","tailwindcss","typescript"],"demo":"https://q2-second-brain-demo.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:41.053Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:41.053Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:41.053Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T18:23:23.072Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T06:11:16.987Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T02:58:41.053Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A personal journaling, planning and habit-tracker app with end-to-end client-side encryption. Two design variants, one codebase. Submitted to Bison Fellowship 2026 as a portfolio artifact.","Q2 is a personal \"Second Brain + Coach\" application. It connects four things that people normally try to track in five different apps:","The app is built around end-to-end client-side encryption: a BIP-39 mnemonic derives an AES-GCM key in the browser; the backend only ever sees ENC: ciphertext. Even the database operator cannot read your journal entries."],"features":["Cascade planning — Year → Quarter → Month → Week → Day, with each level linking to the next.","Daily check-in / check-out — short morning intention, longer evening review, intentionally anti-gamification (no streaks, no XP, no scores).","Knowledge + ideas — markdown notes with inline #tags, freeform journal, quick capture.","An AI coach (server-side, optional) — Claude API runs weekly/monthly/quarterly reviews and confronts the user against their own written constitution.","Dashboard — daily snapshot + cascade widget"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MDRYLA/q2-second-brain-demo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"02fdc58185595ae8ee8ebbcc1cbbb6062ad7de2147a905a25e79f0ca4d26517f","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:23.233Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:23.233Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A personal journaling, planning and habit-tracker app with end-to-end client-side encryption. Two design variants, one codebase. Submitted to Bison Fellowship 2026 as a portfolio artifact.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MDRYLA/q2-second-brain-demo/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"not_required","text":"Demo mode is on by default — no Supabase project, no API keys, no .env.local needed.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MDRYLA/q2-second-brain-demo/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"02fdc58185595ae8ee8ebbcc1cbbb6062ad7de2147a905a25e79f0ca4d26517f","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MDRYLA/q2-second-brain-demo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:23.233Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-03T04:18:04Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MDRYLA/q2-second-brain-demo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:23.234Z","hash":"02fdc58185595ae8ee8ebbcc1cbbb6062ad7de2147a905a25e79f0ca4d26517f","originalBytes":7344,"storedBytes":7344,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:23.072Z","subjects":["Portfolios & personal sites","Writing & documents","Privacy & security"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Design","subjects":["Portfolios & personal sites","Writing & documents","Privacy & security"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Portfolios & personal sites","source":"metadata","match":"portfolio"},{"subject":"Writing & documents","source":"metadata"